WEBVTT

00:10:58.519 --> 00:11:00.504
(Gelach)

00:11:00.504 --> 00:11:04.520
Week 3, bekende mensen --
Entertainment Tonight,

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.586
Access Hollywood.

00:11:06.586 --> 00:11:12.741
Week 4, wereldwijd -- BBC, Ierse Radio.

00:11:12.741 --> 00:11:15.663
Heeft iemand 'Lost in Translation' gezien?

00:11:15.663 --> 00:11:17.852
Mijn man kwam op de Japanse televisie.

00:11:17.852 --> 00:11:19.562
Dat was interessant.

00:11:19.562 --> 00:11:21.614
(Gelach)

00:11:21.614 --> 00:11:27.376
En de video's, de populaire video's.

00:11:27.376 --> 00:11:31.864
Paul Bissonnette's 
gletsjer-video, ongelooflijk.